WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.040
Learn to divide 2-digit numbers by 1-digit number efficiently

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:11.011
Divide 36 divided by 4. The answer is 9. 4 times 9 equals 36.

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:18.059
A teacher puts 244 mangoes into sets of 4. How many full sets can she make? Pause and

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:20.123
solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:25.878
The answer is 61. 4 times 61 equals 244.
